/Build
/Docs
# Xcode per-user UI state (open tabs, breakpoints, window layout). It is written on
# every editor interaction and belongs to one machine, so it is noise in every diff.
# Unlike Debug/ or Release/, "xcuserdata" is an Xcode-reserved name, so matching it
# at any depth is safe: it only ever appears inside .xcworkspace / .xcodeproj.
xcuserdata/
